Enhancement: Support VSS snapshots on Windows arm64

Restic refused to create VSS snapshots on Windows arm64: --use-fs-snapshot
always failed with "executables compiled for arm64 can't use VSS on other
architectures", even for an executable compiled natively for arm64. Restic
now supports creating VSS snapshots on Windows arm64.

https://github.com/restic/restic/issues/3596
https://github.com/restic/restic/pull/22187
